[\fI\,options\/\fR] \fI\,grind <hex-block-header>\/\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
quicksilver\-util version v0.1.0
.PP
The quicksilver\-util tool provides Quicksilver related functionality that does not rely on the ability to access a running node. Available [commands] are listed below.
.SH OPTIONS
.HP
\fB\-help\fR
.IP
Print this help message and exit (also \fB\-h\fR or \-?)
.HP
\fB\-version\fR
.IP
Print version and exit
.PP
Debugging/Testing options:
.PP
Chain selection options:
.HP
\fB\-chain=\fR<chain>
.IP
Use the chain <chain> (default: main). Allowed values: main, publictest,
sandbox
.HP
\fB\-publictest\fR
.IP
Use the Quicksilver Public Test Network. Equivalent to
\fB\-chain\fR=\fI\,publictest\/\fR.
.PP
Commands:
.IP
grind
.IP
Perform proof of work on hex header string
